            "id": 2895354,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Now turn to section four. You will hear part of a lecture on renewable energy that uses the power of the sea. First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2895355,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Now turn to section four.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 2.7199998,
                  "from": 0.16,
